      "side": 1,
      "message": "The safer thing to do here is:\n\nwhile (tx_pending) {\n  STM32_I2C_TXDR(host_i2c_resp_port) \u003d 0xec;\n  usleep(50);\n}\n\nThis will fix your problem without re-enabling tx interrupt, which seems safer. At least behavior would be consistent, we only return from here once the transaction is complete. Are you sure that returning from here before being done isn\u0027t going to cause a problem? I need to look a little closer at the caller.",
